  "abstract": "This experiment marks a return to the successful MoE-ConvGate architecture (ID 30) after abandoning the low-rank factorization research program. It tests the hypothesis that the SOTA model, which was trained with a default learning rate, can be improved through basic hyperparameter optimization. The learning rate is reduced from 0.001 to 0.0003 to seek more stable convergence.",
